  "religion": {
    "_note": "CHAOTIC, totemic, and simple. Race-totem the Stone-Belly / the Ever-Mending (trolls regenerate). The Gashoob groans to the totem and the Gul-spirits in the deep cave; foremost Gul-Waqidu the Devouring-Dark (the endless gut). Trolls demonize Tarul the Burning-Eye above all - FIRE stops their mending, and is their dread.",
