    "shaman_rites": "slow groan-chants in the deep cave; the gnawing of bones; the dread and shunning of fire.",
    "tribal_totem_pattern": "[Atsoom-/Daamog-/Stone-] + [deep-beast or stone]: Atsoom-behoom (Stone-Belly), Daamog-shoonug (Blood-Fang).",
